AmiAirPrint 1.1
================

Native AirPrint / IPP printing for classic AmigaOS 3.0 and newer.

AmiAirPrint integrates network printers with the standard AmigaOS
printer.device system. It supports normal Amiga raster graphics and processed
text without CUPS, a PC print server, or a printer-specific classic driver.

Requirements
------------

- AmigaOS 3.0 or newer
- Motorola 68000 or newer
- TCP/IP stack providing bsdsocket.library
- IPP/AirPrint-capable printer reachable by IPv4

Installation
------------

1. Start Install-AmiAirPrint with Installer 43.3.
2. Select AmigaOS 3.0 / 3.1 or AmigaOS 3.2+.
3. Restart the Amiga.
4. In the normal Printer preferences select:

   Printer: AirPrint
   Port:    Parallel

5. Open SYS:Prefs/AmiAirPrint, use Search... to discover a local printer (or
   enter its IPv4 address manually), query it, choose the desired options and
   save.

Parallel is only a compatibility selection required by classic printer.device.
AmiAirPrint sends the actual print data directly through airprint.device.

Installed files
---------------

SYS:Prefs/AmiAirPrint
SYS:Prefs/AmiAirPrint.info
SYS:DEVS/airprint.device
SYS:DEVS/Printers/AirPrint

The Installer uses the GadTools preferences program on AmigaOS 3.0/3.1 and
ReAction on AmigaOS 3.2+. Both versions use the same AirPrint.prefs settings.

Main features
-------------

- PWG Raster graphics printing through printer.device
- processed PRT:/CMD_WRITE text printing with Latin-1 support
- color and monochrome printing
- Portrait and Landscape
- paper/media, quality and color-mode selection
- 10-100% graphics scaling and optional centering
- IPP printer capability query
- JPEG network test page
- optional locale.library catalogs with built-in English fallback
- local AirPrint / IPP printer discovery via mDNS/DNS-SD
- ReAction.prefs-aware spacing on AmigaOS 3.2+

Verified printing core (unchanged from AmiAirPrint 1.0):

- Personal Paint color graphics printing
- MultiView graphics printing
- IBrowse text-only printing
- built-in monochrome test page


Component versions
------------------

Package / preferences: 1.1
AirPrint printer driver: 43.40
airprint.device: 1.0
AirPrintPrinterTest: 1.0

Localization
------------

English is built into both preferences programs. If an AmiAirPrint.catalog is
available for the selected system language, locale.library loads it
automatically. Locale/AmiAirPrint.cd and the maintained German translation source are
supplied for CatComp, FlexCat or compatible tools.

Known limitations
-----------------

- Discovery is limited to local IPv4 IPP/AirPrint DNS-SD services; manual
  IPv4 configuration remains available.
- IBrowse's classic printer path is text-only and may emit image ALT
  placeholders itself.
- PRD_RAWWRITE is not treated as portable text output.
- Duplex selection is not exposed in the version 1.1 preferences UI.

